WEBVTT

00:00:00.710 --> 00:00:09.760
<i>The countless flowers,
enveloped in light…</i>

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:20.100
<i>…gaze at tomorrow
with unwavering eyes.</i>

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:39.350
<i>Everyone wishes for me to be pure…</i>

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:46.810
<i>…but what can I bring
with me to the frayed skies?</i>

00:00:46.810 --> 00:00:53.900
<i>What I’ve made my own
by breaking off flowers in bloom…</i>

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:59.480
<i>All such sinful things…</i>

00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:06.960
<i>Why did I stop making
promises with the future?</i>

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:14.260
<i>Because even if I try
to run far from all the pain…</i>

00:01:14.260 --> 00:01:20.930
<i>…a cold wind rustles
my hair… Don’t you see?</i>

00:01:20.930 --> 00:01:28.370
<i>Where can I ever find the answer?</i>

00:01:30.770 --> 00:01:31.780
Hold on!

00:01:31.780 --> 00:01:32.720
Big Sister…

00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:36.780
I’m Para-sama’s pair! You can’t
just tell me to team up with Alty now.

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:40.570
This is all for the sake of restoring
Chor Tempest to its former prestige.

00:01:44.980 --> 00:01:46.290
Neviril, look!

00:01:46.920 --> 00:01:48.080
What’s happening?

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:51.090
Why aren’t their prayers
being heard by the Simoun gem?

00:01:51.090 --> 00:01:52.090
Kaim!

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:53.840
Big Sister!

00:01:54.530 --> 00:01:57.340
Don’t call me that!
I said stop calling me that!

00:01:57.340 --> 00:02:03.350
<b>Reason</b>

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:23.030
Their prayers?

00:02:23.030 --> 00:02:27.930
Yes, the divine vehicles are
activated by Simoun sibylla prayers.

00:02:27.930 --> 00:02:31.790
The two priestesses are joined in
spirit as they honor Tempus Spatium.

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:40.510
To reject the one you’re paired with
is the same as rejecting the Simoun.

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:48.520
I really find that hard to believe.
We’ve never heard such a thing.

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:53.660
I’m only speculating.
Even so, thanks to your efforts…

00:02:53.660 --> 00:02:57.030
…we were able to discover
a secret aspect of the Simouns.

00:02:57.030 --> 00:02:58.650
Well done…

00:02:59.280 --> 00:03:01.030
…or would that be
inappropriate to say?

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:04.030
What this means…

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:09.040
…is that my sister and I won’t be
able to fly as a pair anymore, right?

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:15.650
Do you think you
can understand why not?

00:03:15.650 --> 00:03:17.050
Yes.

00:03:27.990 --> 00:03:30.060
No enemies in sight, huh?

00:03:32.290 --> 00:03:35.810
I’m so bored to death it feels
like I’m gonna get moldy all over!

00:03:36.860 --> 00:03:38.070
Pow!

00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:42.450
In other words,
you’d rather we were at war?

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:46.620
I never said that.
It’s just that there’s nothing to do.

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:50.580
Such sinful thoughts should be
banished from your mind right away.

00:03:53.780 --> 00:03:56.910
Oh, I’m so bored! I’m so bored!

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:07.670
She doesn’t look it, but Roatreamon
can be scary when she gets mad.

00:04:07.670 --> 00:04:09.180
Don’t look at me.

00:04:17.600 --> 00:04:19.910
What are you thinking about?

00:04:19.910 --> 00:04:22.320
Something that’s not on your mind.

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:25.110
I see.

00:04:25.110 --> 00:04:27.160
The Emerald Ri Majon?

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:31.160
Right, the ultimate Ri Majon
that can be achieved by a Simoun.

00:04:31.720 --> 00:04:34.860
They say it can inscribe
the final miracle on earth.

00:04:34.860 --> 00:04:36.170
Final?

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:42.000
Simulating the Emerald
Ri Majon of all things.

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:44.880
How would that make
Neviril feel if she saw it?

00:04:46.530 --> 00:04:48.390
Was I doing a Ri Majon?

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:50.480
I get it now.

00:04:50.480 --> 00:04:53.430
So that’s what that was all about.

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:54.560
Aer?

00:04:56.010 --> 00:04:58.220
— Aer.
— Hey, tell me…

00:04:58.220 --> 00:04:59.480
What happens?

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:03.220
Unfortunately,
I’ve never seen it before myself.

00:05:03.220 --> 00:05:05.820
Waporif, didn’t Neviril and Amuria…

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:19.880
So Neviril and Amuria did it.
The Emerald Ri Majon…

00:05:20.570 --> 00:05:21.910
Well…

00:05:21.910 --> 00:05:24.590
I get it! They didn’t succeed.

00:05:27.050 --> 00:05:28.090
That’s right.

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:31.270
So that’s it. Not with Amuria…

00:05:49.630 --> 00:05:52.120
Oh my! You’re so thorough!

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:55.100
The god
Tempus Spatium is a neat freak.

00:05:55.100 --> 00:05:58.610
If the water’s murky,
Tempus Spatium won’t come near.

00:05:58.610 --> 00:06:00.620
That’s what Mother said.

00:06:00.620 --> 00:06:04.590
According to her, misfortune seeps in
through dirty kitchens and bathtubs.

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:08.890
You’re amazing. You know so
many things I’ve never heard of.

00:06:08.890 --> 00:06:11.140
Maybe it best suits me.

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:14.430
Cleaning house
like this, cooking meals…

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:18.640
Maybe I was only
dreaming for a moment.

00:06:19.720 --> 00:06:23.500
It’s so stuck on I can barely
scrape it off! If we had citrus…

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:24.780
Citrus?

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:26.360
The acid rubs stains away.

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:29.610
As I said, you’re amazing!

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:51.640
It’s delicious!

00:07:03.610 --> 00:07:04.650
Neviril!

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:08.650
Do it with me! The Emerald Ri Majon!

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:17.910
Aer! You…

00:07:17.910 --> 00:07:20.620
I know.
It was a bust with Amuria, right?

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:26.880
I know I’ll work out. Come on,
Neviril, let’s do the Emerald…

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:27.630
Stop it!

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:37.640
Wait.

00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:39.140
I’ll get something to wipe that up.

00:07:43.240 --> 00:07:44.400
Neviril, you okay?

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:46.150
Shut up, Aer.

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:47.190
Why?

00:07:47.190 --> 00:07:48.860
We just don’t talk about that…

00:07:51.570 --> 00:07:53.910
Because it reminds
you of Amuria’s death?

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:06.420
Neviril!

00:08:14.430 --> 00:08:16.180
That was just going too far.

00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:19.520
I feel so sorry for Neviril.

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:25.150
I never knew Amuria personally.

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:28.900
But to speak ill of
the dead is an unforgivable sin.

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:31.030
Come on. I was only…

00:08:31.030 --> 00:08:32.280
Come with me.

00:08:37.760 --> 00:08:38.910
Aer…

00:08:52.610 --> 00:08:54.820
Why’d you bring me here?

00:08:54.820 --> 00:08:58.540
Jeez.
Listen, do you love Neviril or not?

00:08:58.550 --> 00:08:59.760
I love her.

00:09:00.650 --> 00:09:02.100
Not like that…

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:03.430
Then how?

00:09:03.430 --> 00:09:08.530
Wishing to chat just a second more
or hold her tight and feel her warmth…

00:09:08.530 --> 00:09:12.270
The kind of love where you
desire her more than anything.

00:09:12.270 --> 00:09:13.610
I desire Neviril.

00:09:15.170 --> 00:09:18.830
If I’m with Neviril,
I know I can fly higher than anyone.

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:21.830
Aer.

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:27.260
Well?

00:09:27.260 --> 00:09:28.330
Well what?

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:29.790
How’d it feel?

00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:33.080
Since we’re not about
to go into battle, it felt weird!

00:09:33.630 --> 00:09:37.260
When you stop feeling that way,
it’ll mean you’re really in love!

00:09:38.530 --> 00:09:42.370
Neviril was in love with Amuria.
Do you get what I’m saying?

00:09:42.370 --> 00:09:45.920
What does that have to do
with the Emerald Ri Majon?

00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:48.810
It’s better in all kinds
of ways when you’re in love!

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:56.320
Neviril!

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:00.570
Neviril!

00:10:02.110 --> 00:10:03.450
Neviril!

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:07.330
Neviril…

00:10:10.050 --> 00:10:11.340
Neviril.

00:10:17.160 --> 00:10:19.590
Don’t worry. It’ll happen with us.

00:10:21.570 --> 00:10:23.530
We can do it.

00:10:43.050 --> 00:10:44.990
The Emerald Ri Majon!

00:10:49.230 --> 00:10:50.520
Amuria…

00:10:52.300 --> 00:10:55.270
Because it reminds
you of Amuria’s death?

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:01.930
Neviril! What’s wrong, Neviril?

00:11:01.930 --> 00:11:02.970
Neviril!

00:11:03.840 --> 00:11:05.180
Neviril!

00:11:05.980 --> 00:11:07.440
Neviril!

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:42.300
I’ll open the window.

00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:48.390
It’s horribly dusty in here, but Aer…

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:50.890
You’d rather not be in the same
room with everybody, right?

00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:53.950
Yes. Thank you.

00:11:56.530 --> 00:11:59.430
All right… you get some rest now.

00:12:23.690 --> 00:12:25.850
The Emerald Ri Majon…

00:12:27.060 --> 00:12:29.180
It must be incredible.

00:12:30.460 --> 00:12:33.440
I’d like to try it too.

00:12:34.030 --> 00:12:35.790
With Dominüra?

00:12:36.600 --> 00:12:39.710
I don’t really mind who I do it with…

00:12:39.710 --> 00:12:42.040
Do you love Dominüra, Rimone?

00:12:43.270 --> 00:12:44.450
I don’t know.

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:50.700
If you do, then you’ll want to kiss even
when you’re not in a Simoun, I hear.

00:12:52.720 --> 00:12:55.790
I hear it’s better in all
ways when you’re in love.

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:57.130
All kinds?

00:12:57.130 --> 00:12:59.490
Right, all kinds.

00:13:11.370 --> 00:13:13.470
What did the Powers That Be say?

00:13:13.470 --> 00:13:16.940
That so long as the enemy’s idle,
we’ll take a wait-and-see approach.

00:13:16.940 --> 00:13:20.980
After discovering that aerial base,
they’re saying to let it go?

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:25.120
It seems an unexpected crisis
occurred aboard the Arcus Prima…

00:13:25.120 --> 00:13:26.950
…and everything’s in chaos.

00:13:27.460 --> 00:13:28.960
As I thought…

00:13:28.960 --> 00:13:32.830
…the here and now is so distracting
that they’re missing the big picture.

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:35.430
If this goes on, Kyuukoku will…

00:13:35.430 --> 00:13:37.710
Sibylla Dominüra…

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:41.840
If I may, you seem
to be in some kind of rush.

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:45.910
Far be it from me to presume
such things of a sibylla…

00:13:45.910 --> 00:13:48.560
Yes, I would say that’s accurate.

00:13:59.690 --> 00:14:00.730
Rimone.

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:03.400
What’s the matter?
Is there some problem?

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:05.990
What is it?

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:11.490
What did you think?

00:14:13.490 --> 00:14:16.000
Did you feel like you were in love?

00:14:24.910 --> 00:14:26.810
Run along now.

00:14:41.790 --> 00:14:44.660
Amuria is… dead.

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:47.420
Neviril?

00:14:48.670 --> 00:14:50.220
Neviril?

00:14:50.800 --> 00:14:52.230
Neviril!

00:14:54.330 --> 00:14:55.540
I was looking for you.

00:14:59.340 --> 00:15:00.570
But why?

00:15:01.550 --> 00:15:03.090
Whoops-a-daisy.

00:15:03.090 --> 00:15:04.750
Now wait a minute…

00:15:04.750 --> 00:15:06.050
You’re not feeling well?

00:15:14.430 --> 00:15:16.550
Look at me, will you?

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:22.940
You could choke in this room.
It’s full of old junk.

00:15:22.940 --> 00:15:25.570
There’s no air circulation.
All that’s left…

00:15:25.570 --> 00:15:28.490
…is useless memories, nothing more.

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:33.570
Let’s go outside.

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:39.330
We’ve got to go.
Let’s open the door together, Neviril.

00:15:42.250 --> 00:15:43.290
Neviril…

00:15:58.470 --> 00:16:00.060
What are you doing?

00:16:06.340 --> 00:16:08.070
T-That hurts, you know!

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:11.260
Neviril’s exhausted. Get out of here.

00:16:11.260 --> 00:16:12.530
Huh? But…

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:13.570
I said get out of here!

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:31.840
Neviril, I don’t think Aer
means you any harm. But…

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:33.130
I want…

00:16:33.720 --> 00:16:35.550
…to get some sleep now.

00:16:36.090 --> 00:16:37.140
Do you mind?

00:16:39.380 --> 00:16:40.840
N-No.

00:17:04.270 --> 00:17:05.500
Where’s Aer?

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:06.880
Who knows?

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:10.160
What she said was
shocking, don’t you think?

00:17:11.410 --> 00:17:14.010
It’s not just Neviril.

00:17:14.010 --> 00:17:17.410
All this time, the rest
of us were avoiding it too.

00:17:18.450 --> 00:17:20.620
Saying those words out loud…

00:17:20.620 --> 00:17:25.050
Because if we did, it felt as though
we’d never be able to move on.

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:28.610
Amuria was so strong.

00:17:29.460 --> 00:17:33.900
Always looking skyward…
She never seemed unsure of herself.

00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:38.910
Yes, war was something
I never thought I could handle…

00:17:40.170 --> 00:17:43.540
…but if she was there,
I thought we couldn’t lose.

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:45.660
That’s how she made me feel.

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:49.240
That’s why I was afraid to admit it.

00:17:49.910 --> 00:17:52.920
No, I still don’t want
to admit it, even now.

00:17:53.680 --> 00:17:54.810
But…

00:18:03.890 --> 00:18:05.140
What’s this?

00:18:06.200 --> 00:18:07.980
Uh, guess I’m busted.

00:18:09.830 --> 00:18:10.990
What is it?

00:18:13.840 --> 00:18:15.650
What’s up with that?

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:23.350
That’s awful!

00:18:23.350 --> 00:18:25.200
What kind of animal is that?

00:18:25.200 --> 00:18:26.230
So funny…

00:18:26.230 --> 00:18:28.960
Excuse me!
I worked really hard sewing it!

00:18:28.960 --> 00:18:31.170
Sure, I made him a little uglier, but…

00:18:31.170 --> 00:18:33.630
Looks like he’s already met his doom.

00:18:34.960 --> 00:18:37.670
No, he hasn’t. He’s so sweet!

00:18:37.670 --> 00:18:41.390
I guess you could
say he took after his creator.

00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:42.890
Hey, you.

00:19:00.820 --> 00:19:03.720
I never wanted to hurt Neviril.

00:19:04.420 --> 00:19:09.030
It’s just that I felt if we were together,
we could accomplish anything.

00:19:09.030 --> 00:19:10.920
How can you be so sure of yourself?

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:16.420
Have you never
experienced utter despair?

00:19:18.840 --> 00:19:20.930
If I had, what good would it do?

00:19:26.210 --> 00:19:30.440
Entrusting Neviril to you
may have been a mistake.

00:19:41.290 --> 00:19:44.070
We can’t afford to wait
for orders from above.

00:19:44.070 --> 00:19:48.340
Now that the enemy’s idle,
we must investigate that aerial base.

00:19:48.340 --> 00:19:51.460
Neviril, Aer, I leave this to you.

00:19:52.670 --> 00:19:54.210
Wait, these two are…

00:19:54.210 --> 00:19:58.080
Those two are, at the moment,
Chor Tempest’s top pair.

00:19:58.080 --> 00:19:59.680
What is the issue?

00:19:59.680 --> 00:20:00.840
But…

00:20:02.350 --> 00:20:06.280
Dominüra, I’m not in a place
where I can team up with Aer.

00:20:07.320 --> 00:20:09.560
You said so
yesterday, right? The Simouns…

00:20:09.560 --> 00:20:11.060
That’s precisely why.

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:16.470
People’s emotions aren’t toys!
If you’re speculating…

00:20:16.470 --> 00:20:17.690
Neviril…

00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:21.400
I… want to fly with you.

00:20:25.170 --> 00:20:27.330
Maybe you don’t want to…

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:29.580
…but I…

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:32.540
Neviril…

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:36.580
I want you to put
Kyuukoku above all else.

00:20:36.580 --> 00:20:40.050
We are Simoun sibyllae after all.

00:21:10.850 --> 00:21:12.010
Worried?

00:21:19.820 --> 00:21:22.960
— I knew it was futile.
— It’s not futile.

00:21:23.590 --> 00:21:26.430
It’s not futile.
You and I will be able to fly.

00:21:26.430 --> 00:21:27.470
You and I…

00:21:43.070 --> 00:21:44.740
Their prayers were heard, it seems.

00:21:44.740 --> 00:21:47.740
So emotional stuff had
nothing to do with it, right?

00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:53.290
That’s not possible. The only
explanation would be that Neviril…

00:21:54.060 --> 00:21:55.750
Neviril…

00:22:04.070 --> 00:22:05.260
But why?

00:22:07.760 --> 00:22:11.970
I knew it. You’re seeking me after all.

00:22:15.450 --> 00:22:19.480
You can fly if you’re with me.
You can do it if you’re with me.

00:22:20.120 --> 00:22:22.880
Am I really seeking Aer?

00:22:23.890 --> 00:22:25.530
Surely not…

00:22:25.530 --> 00:22:28.490
Because I… Because I…

00:22:30.590 --> 00:22:34.360
Because I’m afraid of Aer.

00:22:41.200 --> 00:22:47.920
<i>It is played by my wounds…
the song of prayer.</i>

00:22:47.920 --> 00:22:52.150
<i>Let it ring out over
the grieving universe.</i>

00:22:52.150 --> 00:22:59.190
<i>Can we change tomorrow?
Don’t be afraid.</i>

00:22:59.190 --> 00:23:06.890
<i>I want to let you know
how my heart’s overflowing.</i>

00:23:15.610 --> 00:23:19.710
<i>“I want to get closer to you.”
“I want to feel your pulse.”</i>

00:23:19.710 --> 00:23:24.890
<i>I was too defiant,
and I took the long way around.</i>

00:23:24.890 --> 00:23:28.900
<i>The blue moon is swaying silently.</i>

00:23:28.900 --> 00:23:32.830
<i>My true heart’s desire is you.</i>

00:23:32.830 --> 00:23:38.770
<i>I can’t reach you.
My tears of pain trickle down.</i>

00:23:38.770 --> 00:23:44.250
<i>Soar away into the sky, song of prayer.</i>

00:23:44.250 --> 00:23:47.710
<i>Carrying my love that came too late.</i>

00:23:47.710 --> 00:23:53.410
<i>What can I do to change tomorrow?</i>

00:23:53.410 --> 00:23:59.610
<i>Just hold on to “now” the way it is…</i>

00:24:04.920 --> 00:24:06.590
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:24:06.590 --> 00:24:11.840
Are you telling me to dismantle
a Simoun, Sibylla Dominüra?

00:24:14.090 --> 00:24:15.470
